    {
      "text": "Noah found grace in the eyes of the Lord, Gen. 6:8 (Moses 8:27). thy servant hath found grace in thy sight, Gen. 19:19. if I have found grace in thy sight, Ex. 33:13 (34:9; Judg. 6:17). for a little space grace hath been shewed, Ezra 9:8. Lord will give grace and glory, Ps. 84:11. he giveth grace unto the lowly, Prov. 3:34 (James 4:6; 1 Pet. 5:5). pour upon the house of David … spirit of grace, Zech. 12:10.",
